{
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_353_tactician_ev_talk.txt/6": "同伴会\\c[52]与你身处同一格战斗\\c[0]。他们会跟着你移动，\r\n并且总是紧跟在身边。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_353_tactician_ev_talk.txt/7": "正因为身处同一处，\r\n你随时都能查看他们的HP\r\n状况。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_353_tactician_ev_talk.txt/8": "此外，恢复类技能和物品的效果\r\n也能共享。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_353_tactician_ev_talk.txt/9": "不过，同伴最多只能有3名。\r\n同一格最多容纳4人。\r\n再多就会妨碍行动。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_353_tactician_ev_talk.txt/10": "怎么样？\r\n对你有帮助吗？",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_353_tactician_ev_talk.txt/11": "协力NPC则会\\c[52]在其他格战斗\\c[0]。\r\n比如佣兵和驮运动物。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_353_tactician_ev_talk.txt/12": "没有特殊技能，就看不到他们的剩余HP。\r\n不过只要搭话，\r\n他们就会告诉你自己的状况。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_353_tactician_ev_talk.txt/13": "地形和攻击也会像普通NPC一样\r\n影响他们。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_353_tactician_ev_talk.txt/14": "此外，如果他们处在你的范围攻击内，\r\n也会照常受到你造成的伤害。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_353_tactician_ev_talk.txt/15": "大多数协力NPC\r\n\\c[52]无法越过山地、水域等地形。\\c[0]",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_353_tactician_ev_talk.txt/16": "但只要能配合协力NPC，\r\n就能攻击敌人背后。\r\n这可是极大的优势。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_353_tactician_ev_talk.txt/17": "怎么样？\r\n对你有帮助吗？",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_353_tactician_ev_talk.txt/18": "是吗，果然如此。\r\n祝你好运。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_35_d_shop_gateleeper_ev_talk.txt/0": "出示会员证……",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_35_d_shop_gateleeper_ev_talk.txt/1": "……嗯？",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_35_d_shop_gateleeper_ev_talk.txt/2": "我好像在哪儿见过你……",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_35_d_shop_gateleeper_ev_talk.txt/3": "难道……是、是你！\r\n传说中……",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_35_d_shop_gateleeper_ev_talk.txt/4": "失礼了！\r\n\\c[50]<PLAYER>\\c[0]，欢迎光临！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_35_d_shop_gateleeper_ev_talk.txt/5": "请、请进吧……",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_35_d_shop_gateleeper_ev_talk.txt/6": "\\c[50]\\c[50]<PLAYER>\\c[0]\\c[0]出示了\r\n\\c[52]黑暗许可证\\c[0]。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_35_d_shop_gateleeper_ev_talk.txt/7": "看来不像伪造的。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_35_d_shop_gateleeper_ev_talk.txt/8": "……进去吧。要是惹出麻烦，\r\n我会立刻把你赶出去。\r\n记住了。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_35_d_shop_gateleeper_ev_talk.txt/9": "看来没带在身上……",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_35_d_shop_gateleeper_ev_talk.txt/10": "回去！没有\\c[52]黑暗许可证\\c[0]的人，\r\n不准进这里。不过嘛，\r\n也有人可以靠脸进去……",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_36_d_shop_bag_ev_find.txt/1": "嘿嘿，旅行者！\r\n难道你不想多带些行李吗？",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_36_d_shop_bag_ev_talk.txt/1": "嘿嘿嘿！这边请，小美人！\r\n务必来光顾一下。\r\n包您不亏。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_36_d_shop_bag_ev_talk.txt/2": "嘿嘿嘿！这边请，小哥！\r\n务必来光顾一下。\r\n包您不亏。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_36_d_shop_bag_ev_talk.txt/3": "你的背包，\r\n要不要让我帮你扩充一下？",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_36_d_shop_bag_ev_talk.txt/4": "大了总比小了好！\r\n你绝不会吃亏。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_36_d_shop_bag_ev_talk.txt/5": "不过呀，小美人！\r\n你的背包\r\n已经扩充过了！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_36_d_shop_bag_ev_talk.txt/6": "那么，如果还有别的需要，\r\n再来找我吧！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_36_d_shop_bag_ev_talk.txt/7": "不过呀，小哥！\r\n你的背包\r\n已经扩充过了！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_36_d_shop_bag_ev_talk.txt/8": "那么，如果还有别的需要，\r\n再来找我吧！",
  "choice/data/event/object/udb22_36_d_shop_bag_ev_talk.txt/1293": "拜托了",
  "choice/data/event/object/udb22_36_d_shop_bag_ev_talk.txt/1324": "拜托了\\c[4]_[金额不足]",
  "choice/data/event/object/udb22_36_d_shop_bag_ev_talk.txt/1368": "暂时不用",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_36_d_shop_bag_ev_talk.txt/9": "只要\\c[52]$tmp1拉比斯\\c[0]！\r\n就能让\\c[52]最大WT增加$tmp2\\c[0]，\r\n不做可就亏大了！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_36_d_shop_bag_ev_talk.txt/10": "搞什么，你的钱不够啊！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_36_d_shop_bag_ev_talk.txt/11": "穷光蛋！滚吧！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_36_d_shop_bag_ev_talk.txt/12": "多谢惠顾！\r\n那我这就动手了！！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_36_d_shop_bag_ev_talk.txt/13": "完成了。\r\n好了！一路小心！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_36_d_shop_bag_ev_talk.txt/14": "真的吗？\r\n我觉得挺可惜的……",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_37_d_shop_ev_find.txt/1": "要买点什么吗？",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_37_d_shop_ev_talk.txt/1": "（这身打扮怎么回事？）",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_37_d_shop_ev_talk.txt/2": "你有执照吗？\r\n那就是客人，慢慢挑吧。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_37_d_shop_ev_talk.txt/3": "再来吧。只要执照还在，\r\n我就还会卖东西给你。\r\n行行好，穿上点衣服吧，亲爱的。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_37_d_shop_ev_talk.txt/4": "再来吧。只要执照还在，\r\n我就还会卖东西给你。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_386_soul_ev_talk.txt/0": "（咝。唰——……）",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_386_soul_ev_talk.txt/1": "<TARGET>正\r\n忽隐忽现。\r\n下次会在哪里出现呢？",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_387_poison_soul_ev_talk.txt/0": "（嗡——……）",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_387_poison_soul_ev_talk.txt/1": "<TARGET>正在\r\n可疑地摇晃着。\r\n即使靠近，也没有热度……",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_388_fire_soul_ev_talk.txt/0": "（轰——……）",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_388_fire_soul_ev_talk.txt/1": "<TARGET>正\r\n熊熊燃烧着。\r\n真担心它会不会烧尽……",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_38_d_shop_visitor_ev_find.txt/1": "你是会员吗？",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_38_d_shop_visitor_ev_talk.txt/1": "这里的\\c[52]黑暗公会\\c[0]\r\n是遍布世界各地的会员制公会。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_38_d_shop_visitor_ev_talk.txt/2": "会员证自首次发行100张以来，\r\n从未增发过一张……\r\n你知道这意味着什么吗？",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_38_d_shop_visitor_ev_talk.txt/3": "光是入会，就需要运气、金钱、权势或\r\n才能中的某一样。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_38_d_shop_visitor_ev_talk.txt/4": "所以，你就算穿成这副模样，\r\n也一定在某些方面出类拔萃吧？",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_38_d_shop_visitor_ev_talk.txt/5": "不过，要是在黑道上闯出了名号，\r\n就算没有会员证也进得来。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_38_d_shop_visitor_ev_talk.txt/6": "只有强者才能聚集的公会……\r\n这就是\\c[52]黑暗公会\\c[0]。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_38_d_shop_visitor_ev_talk.txt/7": "所以，这可不是个鼓励犯罪的\r\n公会，别误会了。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_38_d_shop_visitor_ev_talk.txt/8": "不过嘛，我们也不否定犯罪就是了。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_396_lilith_ev_find.txt/0": "呵呵呵呵……",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_396_lilith_ev_talk.txt/0": "呵呵……你对我感兴趣吗？\r\n不过可不行哦？还·得·再·等·等！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_396_lilith_ev_talk.txt/1": "<TARGET>用\r\n撩人的声音低声呢喃。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_397_white_bird_man_ev_talk.txt/0": "啾！啾！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_397_white_bird_man_ev_talk.txt/1": "<TARGET>正\r\n轻飘飘地在四周飞翔。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_400_collect_taxes_ev_darkness.txt/0": "你没有缴纳通行税，\r\n就穿过了关卡！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_400_collect_taxes_ev_darkness.txt/1": "因逃税，通缉度\r\n升至\\c[2]$tmp1\\c[0]！ ",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_400_collect_taxes_ev_dead.txt/0": "通行税尚未缴纳，\r\n征税人就倒下了！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_400_collect_taxes_ev_dead.txt/1": "因逃税，通缉度\r\n升至\\c[2]$tmp1\\c[0]！ ",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_400_collect_taxes_ev_find.txt/0": "通行税请在这里缴纳！\r\n要通过关卡的人，\r\n请务必先到这里来——",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_400_collect_taxes_ev_talk.txt/0": "你可以通过了。",
  "choice/data/event/object/udb22_400_collect_taxes_ev_talk.txt/253": "\\c[0]缴纳通行税_(\\c[52]$tmp1\\c[0]→\\c[52]$tmp2\\c[0]_拉比斯)",
  "choice/data/event/object/udb22_400_collect_taxes_ev_talk.txt/333": "\\c[0]交出身上所有钱_(\\c[52]$tmp1\\c[0]→\\c[52]0\\c[0]_拉比斯)",
  "choice/data/event/object/udb22_400_collect_taxes_ev_talk.txt/635": "\\c[0]恳求_(\\c[52]$tmp1\\c[0]→\\c[52]$tmp2\\c[0]_拉比斯，魅力_\\c[52]$tmp3\\c[0]→\\c[52]$tmp4\\c[0])",
  "choice/data/event/object/udb22_400_collect_taxes_ev_talk.txt/752": "\\c[0]恳求(魅力_\\c[52]$tmp3\\c[0]→\\c[2]$tmp4_不足\\c[0])",
  "choice/data/event/object/udb22_400_collect_taxes_ev_talk.txt/937": "\\c[0]拼命恳求_(\\c[52]免费\\c[0]_魅力_\\c[52]$tmp3\\c[0]→\\c[52]$tmp4\\c[0])",
  "choice/data/event/object/udb22_400_collect_taxes_ev_talk.txt/1038": "\\c[0]拼命恳求(魅力_\\c[52]$tmp3\\c[4]→\\c[2]$tmp4_不足\\c[4])",
  "choice/data/event/object/udb22_400_collect_taxes_ev_talk.txt/1131": "\\c[0]等一下",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_400_collect_taxes_ev_talk.txt/1": "旅行者啊？\r\n我在这里征收通行税。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_400_collect_taxes_ev_talk.txt/2": "无论来者是谁，就算\\c[52]光之灾厄\\c[0]逼近，\r\n通行税也照收不误！\r\n[通行税 \\c[52]$tmp3\\c[0] 拉比斯]",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_400_collect_taxes_ev_talk.txt/3": "请在\\c[52]光之灾厄\\c[0]到来之前，\r\n赶快缴税。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_400_collect_taxes_ev_talk.txt/4": "想靠花言巧语笼络我可不行。\r\n那同样\r\n是确凿的罪名，明白吗？",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_400_collect_taxes_ev_talk.txt/5": "魅力不足……",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_400_collect_taxes_ev_talk.txt/6": "你、你在想什么？！\r\n我要叫人了！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_400_collect_taxes_ev_talk.txt/7": "魅力不足……",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_400_collect_taxes_ev_talk.txt/8": "好，金额没错。\r\n感谢你诚实、规矩地\r\n足额缴纳。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_400_collect_taxes_ev_talk.txt/9": "已缴纳通行税\\c[52]$tmp3\\c[0]拉比斯！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_400_collect_taxes_ev_talk.txt/10": "这是点小意思，\r\n送给依法纳税的人。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_400_collect_taxes_ev_talk.txt/11": "唔，钱不够……？\r\n既然\\c[52]光之灾厄\\c[0]都逼近了，\r\n也没法不放你过去……",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_400_collect_taxes_ev_talk.txt/12": "没办法，就按你身上的全部金额放行吧。\r\n毕竟你确实有缴税的意愿。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_400_collect_taxes_ev_talk.txt/13": "已缴纳通行税\\c[52]$tmp3\\c[0]拉比斯！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_400_collect_taxes_ev_talk.txt/14": "\\c[50]<PLAYER>\\c[0]试着恳求\r\n减免通行税！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_400_collect_taxes_ev_talk.txt/15": "唔唔……就算你\r\n这么可爱地恳求……呜呜。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_400_collect_taxes_ev_talk.txt/16": "真是的，拿你没办法。\r\n半价！不能再便宜了！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_400_collect_taxes_ev_talk.txt/17": "已支付半价通行税\\c[52]$tmp3\\c[0]拉比斯！\r\nCHR等级降至\\c[52]$tmp1\\c[0]！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_400_collect_taxes_ev_talk.txt/18": "等、等等，你在干什么……。\r\n咦？咦咦咦咦！？",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_400_collect_taxes_ev_talk.txt/19": "\\c[50]<PLAYER>\\c[0]为了获准免缴通行税，\r\n使出了全部本事拼命恳求！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_400_collect_taxes_ev_talk.txt/20": "……呼。哇哦。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_400_collect_taxes_ev_talk.txt/21": "啊，呃，好吧。\r\n你可以过去了。\r\n……要对谁保密哦？",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_400_collect_taxes_ev_talk.txt/22": "没缴通行税就过关了！\r\nCHR等级降至\\c[52]$tmp1\\c[0]！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_401_desert_rebel_ev_dead.txt/0": "哎哟哟～",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_401_desert_rebel_ev_dead.txt/1": "救……救命……",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_401_desert_rebel_ev_dead.txt/2": "咕哇……",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_401_desert_rebel_ev_find.txt/0": "别耍我了！杀了你！！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_401_desert_rebel_ev_find.txt/1": "哟哟！瞧瞧这是副什么打扮♪",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_401_desert_rebel_ev_find.txt/2": "啧！是个男人……",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_401_desert_rebel_ev_find.txt/3": "是个女孩……嘿嘿！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_401_desert_rebel_ev_find.txt/4": "在把我扒光抢光之后？",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_401_desert_rebel_ev_find.txt/5": "杀了你……全都抢走！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_401_desert_rebel_ev_find.txt/6": "你是康拉斯领地的人？",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_401_desert_rebel_ev_find.txt/7": "是康拉斯送来的猎物！！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_401_desert_rebel_ev_find.txt/8": "男人统统杀掉！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_401_desert_rebel_ev_find.txt/9": "先从你下杀手吗……",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_401_desert_rebel_ev_talk.txt/0": "干、干什么……。\r\n我才不是你的同伴。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_401_desert_rebel_ev_talk.txt/1": "<TARGET>嘴上这么说，\r\n却忍不住咧嘴笑了……。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_402_beast_rebel_ev_dead.txt/0": "哎哟哟～",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_402_beast_rebel_ev_dead.txt/1": "救……救命……",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_402_beast_rebel_ev_dead.txt/2": "咕哇……",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_402_beast_rebel_ev_find.txt/0": "别耍我了！杀了你！！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_402_beast_rebel_ev_find.txt/1": "哟哟！瞧瞧这是副什么打扮♪",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_402_beast_rebel_ev_find.txt/2": "啧！是个男人……",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_402_beast_rebel_ev_find.txt/3": "是个女孩……嘿嘿！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_402_beast_rebel_ev_find.txt/4": "在把我扒光抢光之后？",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_402_beast_rebel_ev_find.txt/5": "杀了你……全都抢走！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_402_beast_rebel_ev_find.txt/6": "让你见识一下半兽人的力量！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_402_beast_rebel_ev_find.txt/7": "是康拉斯送来的猎物！！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_402_beast_rebel_ev_find.txt/8": "男人统统杀掉！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_402_beast_rebel_ev_find.txt/9": "先从你下杀手吗……",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_402_beast_rebel_ev_talk.txt/0": "干、干什么……。\r\n你只是我的猎物！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_402_beast_rebel_ev_talk.txt/1": "<TARGET>嘴上这么说，\r\n尾巴却出卖了真心，摇个不停。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_404_knights_ev_appear.txt/0": "喔喔——我要保护女王！！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_404_knights_ev_appear.txt/1": "为了女王陛下！！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_404_knights_ev_appear.txt/2": "我要恪守骑士的誓言！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_404_knights_ev_appear.txt/3": "呜喔喔喔——！！",
