  "message/data/event/object/udb22_406_pegasus_ev_dead.txt/0": "\\c[2]猎杀动物罪\\c[0]现在为\\c[2]$tmp1\\c[0]！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_406_pegasus_ev_find.txt/0": "咴——！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_406_pegasus_ev_talk.txt/0": "咴咴咴——！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_406_pegasus_ev_talk.txt/1": "<TARGET>正\r\n精神十足地飞来飞去。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_431_duelist1_ev_appear.txt/1": "是你，召吾前来吗？",
