  "message/data/event/object/udb22_431_duelist1_ev_appear.txt/3": "但是！！\r\n若吾获胜，\r\n便取你性命！！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_431_duelist1_ev_darkness.txt/0": "嘎啊——……",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_431_duelist1_ev_darkness.txt/1": "决斗者被光\r\n吞没了……",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_431_duelist1_ev_dead.txt/0": "唔……很强。\r\n竟能胜过吾……人类。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_431_duelist1_ev_dead.txt/1": "很好……吾愿加入\r\n你的旅程。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_431_duelist1_ev_dead.txt/2": "战胜决斗者，\r\n他成为了你的护卫！\r\n他会跟随你300km！"
